  "prefLabel": "En 1017.01 Annual Report Reporting Period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1017.01 Annual Report Reporting Period. Each utility shall provide to the department an annual report by April 1 of each year. The reporting period for all information required by this part shall be for the most recent past calendar year.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
